+/*!
+ * \file   tests/FieldOperationsTest.hxx
+ * \brief  This file implements tests of the field operations of a backend,
+ * and of a complete cycle in the memory of this backend: integration of a
+ * behaviour generated by the `generic-parallel` interface on arrays stored
+ * component by component in the memory of the backend, and update of the
+ * states with the field operations of the backend. The results are compared
+ * to the integration point by point on the host. Asynchronous computations
+ * whose statuses are allocated by a pool of memory shared by the host and
+ * the backend are also checked, as well as the rotations, the evaluations of
+ * material properties, the initialize functions and the post-processings on
+ * views of arrays of the backend.
+ *
+ * The backend is described by a class satisfying the
+ * `FieldOperationsTestBackend` concept: see `FieldOperationsCUDATest.cu`
+ * and `FieldOperationsParallelSTLTest.cxx`.
+ * \date   19/10/2026
